V1 inp 0 dc 0 ac 1
I1 0 opout dc 0 ac 1
G1 0 u1p inp 0 1m
RP1 u1p 0 3.162278g
CP1 u1p 0 3.979p
E1 u1e 0 u1p 0 1
RO1 u1e u1z 0.722
LO1 u1z opout 893n
RL1 u1z opout 58.8
.probe v opout
.end
"

